<title>ECUADOR: SOCCER-ECUADOR BEAT VENEZUELA 1-0 IN WORLD CUP.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ECUADOR BEAT VENEZUELA 1-0 IN WORLD CUP.</headline>
<dateline>QUITO 1996-09-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ecuador beat Venezuela 1-0</p>
<p>(halftime 1-0) in a South American World Cup qualifying match on</p>
<p>Sunday.</p>
<p>Scorer: Alex Aguinaga (4th minute)</p>
<p>Attendance: 45,000</p>
